#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:1
#: cf15590e9afb43d9bce67dfddc99f969
msgid "Driver layer parameters"
msgstr "驱动层参数"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:3
#: 99658e30ddf44a1f8bb36c0ea1fb92e0
msgid ""
"ros2_control **driver layer** (驱动层) plugin arguments — Hardware Interface"
" / `<ros2_control><hardware>` `<param>` entries, loaded in the plugin "
"`on_init`. They are **not** the same API as `ros2 param list` on a "
"controller node."
msgstr ""
"ros2_control **驱动层**插件参数 — `Hardware Interface` / "
"`<ros2_control><hardware>` 下的 `<param>`，在插件 `on_init` 加载。与控制器节点上的 "
"`ros2 param list` **不是**同一套 API。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 50069542c1b44a4ea7519cf077828948
msgid ""
"How the launch `hardware:=` key selects a plugin: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). How to inspect "
"controllers vs the driver layer: [Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"launch 的 `hardware:=` 如何选插件：[本栈中的 "
"ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。如何查看控制器 vs 驱动层：[配置"
" ROS 2 控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:7
#: 945f3eed7d0e4a5e983f4c66fa2b8b4f
msgid ""
"The in-tree [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/README.md)"
" is **build-only** (`colcon build --packages-up-to …`). Parameter names "
"live in each driver-layer README and in the robot xacro. **When** tags "
"below match [topic_based README in #120](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"树内 [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/README.md)"
" 只讲**编译**（`colcon build --packages-up-to …`）。参数名在各驱动层 README 和机型 xacro "
"中。下面的**何时生效**与 [#120 的 topic_based README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)"
" 一致。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:9
#: 3998ffc6fc5d4b02971eacbca0d239a0
msgid "topic_based_ros2_control"
msgstr "topic_based_ros2_control"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:11
#: 8427ac4339df43aebd430afe1fe72389
msgid ""
"Public plugin used when `hardware:=isaac` (Acone xacro: "
"`/isaac/joint_command`, `/isaac/joint_states`). README: "
"[#120](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)."
" Source pin: [`9a1da3ba` `topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=isaac` 时使用的公开插件（Acone "
"xacro：`/isaac/joint_command`、`/isaac/joint_states`）。README：[#120](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)。源码钉在"
" [`9a1da3ba` `topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:13
#: 7dff79f8a80946edae3cc6b4a177e415
msgid "Plugin class: `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`."
msgstr "插件类：`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:15
#: e0b9b7d1143048fcba146975ef97446e
msgid ""
"These are `info_.hardware_parameters` / per-joint `joint.parameters`, "
"read in `on_init`. There is no `declare_parameter` and no "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`. Changing any of them requires "
"restarting the hardware / `controller_manager` (**Startup only**)."
msgstr ""
"它们是 `info_.hardware_parameters` / 每关节 `joint.parameters`，在 `on_init` "
"读取。没有 `declare_parameter`，也没有 "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`。改其中任何一项都需要重启硬件 / "
"`controller_manager`（**仅启动**）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 2fbf106d0afc4e8493fe35274298dfe1
msgid "README example:"
msgstr "README 示例："

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:19
#: d544f7aa239d4d41af2ff6277aceb474
msgid ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"
msgstr ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"

