msgid ""
"`true`: first received state becomes the command (avoids a jump). "
"`false`: use state_interface `initial_value`. **Startup only**."
msgstr ""
"`true`：用首次收到的状态作为命令（避免突跳）。`false`：使用 state_interface 的 "
"`initial_value`。**仅启动**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:19
#: add4096ff1ef4a2ab70d361b3668863a
