msgstr "其他公开驱动层插件"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:46
#: 73270ce9264e4832bffad0ec359cb1c9
msgid ""
"Vendor plugins and the `<param>` names already listed on [Public driver "
"layer](1-public_hi.md) (for example ARX `can_interface`, Dobot `robot_ip`"
" / `robot_port`, HighTorque `serial_port`, Modbus `serial_port` / "
"`baudrate`). Those pages are the parameter lists. They are xacro "
"`<param>` values at plugin load — same **Startup only** rule as above."
msgstr ""
"厂商插件以及 [公开驱动层](1-public_hi.md) 已列出的 `<param>` 名（例如 ARX 的 "
"`can_interface`、Dobot 的 `robot_ip` / `robot_port`、HighTorque 的 "
"`serial_port`、Modbus 的 `serial_port` / `baudrate`）。那些页面就是参数表。它们是插件加载时的 "
"xacro `<param>` — 与上面相同的 **仅启动** 规则。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:48
#: 81cf965689804e6a99167825762b90b5
msgid "Use the plugin class from that robot’s `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro`."
msgstr "插件类以该机型 `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` 为准。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:50
#: 53f89e0997d44d528e059e67384a53e4
msgid "Private driver layer"
msgstr "私有驱动层"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:52
#: 0070fd2112bb4cae9b58a57f26a80cf0
msgid ""
"[Private driver layer](2-private_hi.md) names the private packages "
"(Rokae, Eyou, iNex, Wuji, DexCap, Fairino). Configuration keys, IP/serial"
" layouts, and SDK env vars are in **that repository’s README after "
"access**. This page does not list undocumented private SDK parameters. "
"#120 likewise skipped private `hardwares/*` gitmodules."
msgstr ""
"[私有驱动层](2-private_hi.md) "
"列出私有包（Rokae、Eyou、iNex、Wuji、DexCap、Fairino）。配置键、IP/串口布局和 SDK 环境变量见**开通后该仓库"
" README**。本页不罗列未写入文档的私有 SDK 参数。#120 同样跳过了私有 `hardwares/*` gitmodules。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:54
#: 517a5a491805431f84021594f107f16a
msgid "SDK build notes: [SDK Notes](3-sdk_notes.md)."
msgstr "SDK 编译说明：[SDK 说明](3-sdk_notes.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:56
#: 24fe2c146450474d95f6991c3161403e
